  title: THE OATHFIRE TRIAL
  briefing: 'Welcome, traveler. Our hearth grows cold, and the old vows must be renewed.


    Defeat three guardians in the eastern proving circle and gather their Oathfire Embers. Face the warden, rekindle the brazier, then return to me.


    Your companions share this trial. Each earns a reward.'
